From 9bf03695855b3174002fc68642fc64707d899350 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ran shalit <rshalit@habana.ai>
Date: Thu, 30 Dec 2021 12:40:02 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-36155] i2c_ind: move proto hdr to c

